<title>USA: Deere &amp; Co Q1 Jan 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>Deere &amp; Co Q1 Jan 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MOLINE, Ill. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.69		    $0.63</p>
<p> Net			176,700		  166,200</p>
<p> Revs		   2,396,000		2,318,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 256,129		  262,229</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 net sales and revenues include $2.0 billion in total net sales, $354.0 million in financial services revenues and $39.0 million in other revenues.  </p>
<p>Q1 1996 revenues include $1.94 billion in total net sales, $347.0 million in financial services revenues and $34.0 million in other revenues.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
